Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.03,0:04:01.22,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(661.333,202.667)}能够互相理解、
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.03,0:04:01.22,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(520,238.667)}有时会有这种感觉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.03,0:04:01.22,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(373.333,314.667)}虽然无法理解的时候也很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.03,0:04:01.22,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(814.667,166.666)}超乎想象地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.03,0:04:01.22,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(1140,322.666)}第四页
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:10.60,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,10,100,0,400,1000,2200)\frz-90\1c&HEDA3F2&\pos(1212.667,178)}女神们
